        "text": "Summary\nMore than 80 percent of a cybersecurity consultant\u2019s time is likely spent on web\napplication pentests. You are highly encouraged to master this topic before you\nproceed further in this book. The simple formula to master any skill is based\non two factors: knowledge and practice (the inherited skill is a minor factor as\nwell). The information shared with you in this chapter should help you to start\ntesting web applications like a boss.\nWhat\u2019s next? In the upcoming chapter, we will dive deep into the Linux priv-\nilege escalation concept.",
